<title>USA: PECO sees Pa. nuke back on line late Thurs..</title>
<headline>PECO sees Pa. nuke back on line late Thurs..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>PECO Energy Co said Thursday it expects to restart its 1,100 megawatt (MW) Peach Bottom nuclear unit 2 this evening.</p>
<p>&quot;The unit has not restarted yet. It won't be until this evening, and then it will begin its ramp-up through Friday and into the weekend,&quot; said company spokesman Michael Wood.</p>
<p>The unit, located in Delta, Pa., was taken off line early Wednesday due to a problem with the oil line to the generator. The company had originally expected to begin restart this morning.</p>
<p>--H McCulloch, New York Power Desk +212-859-1628</p>
